<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman rates Thermedics buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman rates Thermedics buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Jeffrey Kessler initiated coverage of Thermedics Detection Inc with a buy rating and a &quot;conservative&quot; 12-month price target of $18.</p>
<p>-- The company is a maker of detection and measurement systems.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/2 at 10-3/4.</p>
</text>
